 "answer": "This confirms the Skybridge de-SPAC transaction (matter 1009-00003) is how Skybridge Fintech Ltd. went public. The combined company became Skybridge Fintech Holdings, Inc., trading on Nasdaq under ticker SBFT. We served as counsel to Skybridge (the portfolio company).\n\nI now have a comprehensive picture. Let me finalize my analysis.\n\n**Portfolio companies of Pinnacle Venture Fund II LP identified in our engagement records:**\n\n1. **Lumos Analytics Inc.** (client 1008) - IPO (matter 1008-00002) was **WITHDRAWN** - NOT taken public\n2. **Skybridge Fintech Ltd.** (client 1009) - de-SPAC (matter 1009-00003) **COMPLETED** - taken public\n3. **Arbor Health Technologies Inc.** (client 1010) - IPO (matter 1010-00002) **COMPLETED** - taken public\n4. **Luminos Systems Inc.** (matter 1002-00005) - no IPO - NOT taken public\n5. **ClearArc Software Inc.** (matter 1002-00005) - no IPO - NOT taken public\n6. **Vectral Cloud Inc.** (matter 1002-00005) - no IPO - NOT taken public\n7. **Quillen Technologies, Inc.** (matter 1002-00002) - no IPO - NOT taken public\n\nThe portfolio companies we have taken public are **Arbor Health Technologies Inc.** (matter 1010-00002) and **Skybridge Fintech Ltd.** (matter 1009-00003).\n\nLet me provide my final answer.\n\nBased on my research, the Pinnacle Venture Fund II LP portfolio companies that our firm has taken public are:\n\n**Arbor Health Technologies Inc.** — We served as issuer's counsel for its IPO of common stock on the NYSE (ticker ARHT). The offering priced on February 8, 2024 and closed on February 13, 2024 (matter **1010-00002**).\n\n**Skybridge Fintech Ltd.** — We served as counsel to Skybridge in its de-SPAC business combination with Pinnacle Growth Acquisition Corp. (PGAC). The transaction closed on July 21, 2025, and the combined company (Skybridge Fintech Holdings, Inc.) began trading on Nasdaq under ticker SBFT (matter **1009-00003**).\n\nI should note that **Lumos Analytics Inc.** (also a Fund II portfolio company) had an IPO engagement (matter 1008-00002), but that offering was **withdrawn** on June 15, 2022 before any securities were sold, so Lumos was not taken public.\n\nThe other Fund II portfolio companies identified in our records — Luminos Systems Inc., ClearArc Software Inc., Vectral Cloud Inc. (matter 1002-00005), and Quillen Technologies, Inc. (matter 1002-00002) — have no IPO engagements in our records.\n\n**Qualifying matters: 1010-00002, 1009-00003**",
